Source: artcraft-launcher
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher

Package: artcraft-launcher
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set: upstream's own DEB Depends verified correct as-is
# (t64-era names need no adjustment for this set on Debian Testing).
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libc6 (>= 2.35), libegl1, libgcc-s1, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxkbcommon0
Description: App launcher for the Craft suite
 ArtCraft Launcher: the app launcher for the Craft suite of clean-room
 creative tools.
